    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Storyline</h2><br>You've just joined a university laboratory as an assistant. But on your first day, you receive shocking news from the lab's head, Prof. Shiika...<br><br>&quot;Welcome, new assistant!&quot;<br>&quot;I'll explain your first job right away!&quot;<br><br>&quot;Our lab will be gone next month! It's your job to prevent that!&quot;<br><br>A lab standing on the brink of disaster.<br>Prof. Shiika, a genius but an outrageous social misfit.<br>And the unidentified squiddies, the subjects of the professor's research...<br><br>Thus begins your outrageous research life, where everything pulls you in different directions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Adventure Part</h2><br>Prof. Shiika is a super-grade social misfit.<br>But you can't abandon her as an assistant.<br>Listen to her story carefully!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Experiment Part</h2><br>Experiments are essential for conducting research. And the experimental part takes the form of an action game!<br>The stars of this section are the Squiddies, the subjects of the professor's research.<br>Control Squiddy and skewer your enemies with its pointed head!<br>(There are high-level challenges for those with great skills!)<br><br>With the pride of a scientist, let's start the grand experiment of the century!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Local Multiplayer</h2><br>It is possible for two players to play the action game part against each other.<br>One or more XInput-compatible gamepads are required for this.",
